# Sign detection: generated data and weights stay on the machine that made
# them. Everything under dataset/ is derived and can be rebuilt, so it is safe
# to delete the whole directory. The photographs and the hand-drawn labels that
# cannot be rebuilt live in assets/real/ and are versioned.
